' emp6-includes.lbl: i.empire's line labels for its modules (i/emp.*), as a
' table: nothing includes it (C64List 4.04 can't name a line in another
' file), so the modules jump to these lines as {$33}nnn.
' each is its Image 1.2 number plus 3000 (games/empire6/includes.lbl).
' Image 3.0's im lines come from 3_0-preface.lbl.
' ----------line label assignments-----------------
